<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  The drawer's static styles, cached as one file: shopify/assets/cart-drawer.css
  holds cart-drawer-addons, this snippet, cart-drawer-polish and
  cart-drawer-sheets, in that order. Storelib moves the link into the head in
  the place these styles held, so the cascade is unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'cart-drawer.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
</template>
